sg-mail (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First package: SG Mail, Stained Glass OS's mail and calendar, built on
    Debian's unmodified Thunderbird. /usr/bin/sg-mail runs Thunderbird with
    SG Mail's own profile; our extension (sg-mail@stained-glass-os.org)
    makes its main window SG Mail's: ribbon, folder pane with Favorites and
    unread counts, message list grouped by date, reading pane (HTML made
    safe, pictures from the network on request), message window (rich text,
    names from the address book, attachments, signatures, drafts, replies
    under Outlook-style headers), Calendar (Day / Work Week / Week / Month,
    appointments, recurrence, meetings and invitations, reminders as desktop
    notifications, .ics import/export), Outlook's keys, mailto: handler,
    light and dark. Gates: test/gate/*-gate.py with mutants (make test,
    make test-mutation).

 -- Stained Glass OS <dev@stained-glass.example>  Mon, 05 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0000
